# A station that reports humidity and pressure and no wind or temperature -- an indoor
# barometer-and-hygrometer station, which CWOP accepts. The dotted fields are the protocol's
# "unavailable", and the case the Go builder renders as `.../...g...t000` because it formats
# a non-nullable struct: `t000` is -18 C and no receiver can tell it from a reading.
# Southern hemisphere, so the latitude hemisphere byte is `S` and the longitude `W`.
!3345.00S/07030.00W_.../...g...t...h72b10131.mw1.0
